|=======================================================|
|		Pong_u (WiiU)				|
|=======================================================|

[ Required packages ]
- DevKitPro
- DevKit PowerPC
- SDL2 for WiiU
- Cmake, Make, Bash

[ How to compile ]

$ source set_path.sh
$ cd build
$ powerpc-eabi-cmake ..
$ make

[ How to install ]

# For Aroma
Copy Pong_u.wuhb to SD:/wiiu/apps/Pong_u/
Launch from system menu

# For Legacy envirnoments:
Copy Pong_u.rpx to SD:/wiiu/apps/Pong_u/
(optional) Copy the meta/ folder to SD:/wiiu/apps/Pong_u/
Launch with Homebrew Launcher app

You can debug the executable with wiiu-ld or GDB via Pong_u.elf
